        "original_id": "fbd6da8b-a36f-5156-b625-6b16d9ebc452",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: R. D. Reid, Zack Snyder, George A. Romero, James Gunn, Sarah Polley, Ving Rhames, Jake Weber, Mekhi Phifer, Kevin Zegers, Michael Hornburg, Bella Heathcote, Penelope Mitchell, Lucas Till, Zane Holtz, Helen Slater, Tom Arnold\n- Products: Dawn of the Dead (2004 film), Diary of the Dead, Dawn of the Dead (1978 film), Transamerica, It's a Boy Girl Thing, The Jane Austen Book Club, Fifty Dead Men Walking, Frozen, The Curse of Downers Grove, Downers Grove\n- Topics: film remakes, film casts, novel adaptations\n\nFacts:\n- George A. Romero made the 1978 film Dawn of the Dead, which was later remade as Dawn of the Dead (2004 film).\n- Michael Hornburg wrote the 1999 novel Downers Grove, which The Curse of Downers Grove is based on.\n- Dawn of the Dead (2004 film) was written by James Gunn and stars Sarah Polley, Ving Rhames, Jake Weber, and Mekhi Phifer.\n- R. D. Reid appeared in Zack Snyder's Dawn of the Dead and in George A. Romero's Diary of the Dead.\n- Kevin Zegers starred in Dawn of the Dead (2004), Transamerica (2005), It's a Boy Girl Thing (2006), The Jane Austen Book Club (2007), Fifty Dead Men Walking (2008), and Frozen (2010).\n- The Curse of Downers Grove stars Kevin Zegers, Bella Heathcote, Penelope Mitchell, Lucas Till, Zane Holtz, Helen Slater, and Tom Arnold.",
